you improve your skill and experience,\ncome to this tower again, and\nI'll open this door for you.\n","1000010":"We're waiting for a stronger man to pass through.\nComplete more missions and come back again!\n","1000011":"Holly Spirit of life!\nHeal this evil wound!\n","1000012":"I will heal any wound.\n","1000013":"Hang in there.\n","1000014":"I've got good things.\n \n \u30fb~Trade Items           ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                       ~QUIT~\n","1000015":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000016":"Not enough money.\n","1000017":"Already fixed.\n","1000018":"I need %d in gold to identify your item. OK?\n \n                 ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000019":"All identified.\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,2],[0,3,10000001,3],[0,5,4294967295,5],[0,0,10000300,8],[0,0,10000301,9],[0,0,10000900,10],[0,5,4294967295,11],[0,0,10000200,18],[0,0,12000000,19],[0,1,12000000,25],[0,0,12000001,32],[0,1,12000001,33],[0,0,12000002,87],[0,1,12000002,96]],"blocks":[[[6,[[1,0],[1,8]]],[49,[[2,1000000]]],[50,[[4,1000004]]],[0,[[4,1000004],[0,0],[1,50],[0,1]]]],[[16,[[4,1000073],[1,0],[6,10000200],[7,10000200]]]],[[17,[[1,99000012],[1,1]]]],[[0,[[11,85],[0,2],[1,9],[0,4]]]],[[17,[[1,99000014],[1,0]]]],[[0,[[11,85],[0,2],[1,9],[0,6]]],[0,[[11,85],[0,3],[1,10],[0,7]]]],[[56,[[1,10011000],[1,0],[1,0],[1,0]]],[56,[[1,10011001],[1,1],[1,1],[1,1]]],[56,[[1,10011002],[1,1],[1,1],[1,1]]]],[[56,[[1,10011000],[1,1],[1,1],[1,1]]],[56,[[1,10011001],[1,0],[1,0],[1,0]]],[56,[[1,10011002],[1,0],[1,0],[1,0]]]],[[41,[[0,0]]]],[[41,[[0,0]]]],[[41,[[1,1]]]],[[34,[[1,10000202],[4,1000004]]],[0,[[4,1000004],[0,0],[1,0],[0,12]]],[0,[[4,1000004],[0,2],[1,0],[0,17]]]],[[0,[[10,24],[0